
>> Animal := Into entsha.
Animal xa-kufika: ['entsha'] yenza: { <- ngokwakho entsha init.
}.

Animal xa-kufika: ['init'] yenza: {
	eyakho sound := ['?'].
	eyakho legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal entsha.
Dog xa-kufika: ['init'] yenza: {
	ngokwakho init.
	eyakho sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal xa-kufika: ['umbhalo'] yenza: { <- eyakho legs umbhalo + eyakho sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog entsha.
Imveliso bhala: poodle, umgca-omtsha.

